CHANGES IN mapmisc VERSION 2.1.4

    o Documentation updated for terra (SpatVector / SpatRaster); geocode()
      docs now describe Nominatim rather than Google/dismo.
    o Tile downloads send an identifying User-Agent; OSM and other tile
      URLs audited (HTTPS preferred; dead providers pruned).
    o Deprecated +init=epsg: CRS strings replaced with epsg: codes.
    o persistentCache() avoids writing beside tempdir() under R CMD check.
    o Packaging hygiene: .Rbuildignore, Encoding, versioned License,
      URL/BugReports fields; dead geocodeOld / dismo stubs removed.

CHANGES IN mapmisc VERSION 2.1.3

    o Bug fixes and vignette rebuilds for the terra-based release line.
